The packaged binary is the unmodified `wallloop` artifact published in the
upstream project's GitHub Releases; its SHA256 is pinned in the UPSTREAM
file of this repository. The TOS packaging metadata, build scripts and
documentation in this repository are licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

Runtime dependency (NOT bundled): ffmpeg — used by the packaged binary via
exec for media probing, thumbnails and local demo-wallpaper synthesis; on
TerraMaster TOS the factory-provided /usr/bin/ffmpeg is used. No upstream
or CDN media assets are shipped or downloaded: all wallpapers come from
user uploads or local ffmpeg synthesis.
